  "description": "The ExpertPdf Anywhere library for .NET on Linux ARM64 and Docker. This package contains no code: it installs ExpertPdf.Anywhere (HTML to PDF and HTML to image, RTF to PDF, PDF creation, merge, split, security and digital signatures, PDF to text and PDF to image, PDF/A and PDF/UA) together with the engine package for linux-arm64. The engine is bundled, so Docker images need no apt-get. Requires glibc 2.30 or later. For Linux x64, use ExpertPdf.Anywhere.Linux.",
